    "q-53173": {
      "dom_id": "step-q53173",
      "name": "Question 6",
      "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14176224/assets/d607ba743afcc7d39299278e0d352e2c644b587480834a5c68cf2b46687b7f73.png)\n\nWhat is the value of $t$ given that $∠VOZ$ is a right angle?",
      "worked_solution": "Since $∠VOZ$ is a right angle, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}m∠VOZ={90}^{∘},\\,m∠VOW=m∠YOZ={30}^{∘}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we can form an equation and solve for $t$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}m∠VOW+m∠WOX+m∠XOY+m∠YOZ & =m∠VOZ \\\\ {30}^{∘}+t+t+{30}^{∘} & ={90}^{∘} \\\\ 2t & ={30}^{∘} \\\\ t & ={15}^{∘}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
